  "description": "This was a big question mark but it couldn’t have gone better. Picked up a burrito and an Ethan in Nederland, then bopped over the continental divide to my NYE Air BnB. Surprisingly never even had to swap to shoes! This day had it all: pow, skinning, skating (a lot of skating, a lot of SLOW deep skating), boot packing, trains, tunnels, and now it’s time for dinner and a hot tub.",
